      {
        "id": "16",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "Recording: press R. With Arm vocal on (F5), the Record node writes a take only inside the transport's punch range, bars 5 and 6 (Shift-drag on the ruler to move it), starting on its exact sample; recording from a stop counts in one bar of click first (right-click the metronome button). Monitor passes the input to the track so you hear yourself; it starts off, so the microphone is quiet until you turn it on. After the take, Create Clip from take places the clip at the beat the take started and wires it where the microphone went. There are no take lanes."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            3260.0
          ],
          "size": [
            760.0,
            110.0
          ]
        }
      },
